f(6,'text','A ThreadSanitizer runtime with its supported pthread lock-order detector enabled','Capabilityconditional.',ts,o=1)
f(6,'explanation','Correct. Supported instrumented pthread lock operations can populate the detector\'s graph; check runtime support and configuration rather than relying on a universal default.','Defaultnotuniversallyavailable.',ts,o=1)
