f(7,'text','Class tracking generalizes observed order constraints across instances and keeps the graph manageable','Observationnotproofofallfutureorders.',ld,o=3)
f(7,'explanation','Classes generalize observed dependencies across instances. Correct class/subclass annotations and coverage matter; wrong annotations or unobserved paths can still hide real deadlocks.','Do not assert nomisses.',ld,o=2)
